Nested Wayland backend: the host seat's touchscreen is gamescope's. Its
touches go to wlserver_touchdown/motion/up, normalized over the output as
the pointer's motion is, so they follow the touch mode (SteamOS passes them
through to Steam and games, as the Deck's own touchscreen). The backend
held a wl_touch but never bound it.

--- a/src/Backends/WaylandBackend.cpp
